      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not wasting anything, you're just not living up to the expectations. It's okay to feel like a shadow, but remember, you don't have to carry their dreams. You can always find a way to make your own path, even if it's not what they wanted. Sometimes, letting go of the past can be the hardest part, but it's also the most freeing. You deserve to be happy, even if it means being different from them.",
