      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"finding peace\" sounds nice, but honestly... i think i mean something else. like, if i just vanished, they could finally stop looking at me and feeling that shame. they could just eventually forget the failure. do you think it would actually be easier for them if i just wasn't a part of their lives anymore?",
